    },
    {
      "dom_id": "step-589680",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Solving an Inhomogeneous System Using a Given Matrix Exponential",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/b295374b3b08a5d81309c92f39b38e29f1e44159a8c96e7fdfeb4cc561818585.svg)\nFind the solution to the initial value problem above.\n\n*Hint: ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/e773bbc2fc731a397cc747fffa2e5424a30a513e8b56e0337c56bbbe7953f837.svg) where ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/9b205047979771af4c5e88a6a9798729cb464fa080b0b46cbfc70b3c77ce8a83.svg)*",
      "worked_solution": "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/8004eea851883dbf0360ca3e5f39678967cdf5060668508f65cf3e5d54d6b027.svg)\nwhere ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/ebe84b2cfbe7f95afe2c819b1d1d7790061c81744295076ac5bc739c13832dbe.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/edd1f7c4e50501b6849b37c98e822621d64d2f5d90a5de35b96d569814bb2a3a.svg) So, the matrix of the system is ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/5c91edafde3ff3c119a58783296b9f8c56ecd3604d6b663af6d764a911fe1d72.svg)\n\nGiven the system $\\mathbf{x}'(t) = A \\mathbf{x}(t)+\\mathbf{g}(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the solution of the initial value problem can be written as the sum of the homogeneous part and a particular solution:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{x}(t) = \\underbrace{e^{A(t-t_0)} \\, \\mathbf{x}(t_0)}_{\\text{homogeneous part}} + \\underbrace{\\int_{t_0}^{t} e^{A(t-s)} \\mathbf{g}(s) \\, \\text{d}s}_{\\text{particular solution}},\n$$\n\nwhere $\\mathbf x(t_0)$ is the initial condition vector. \n\nLet's evaluate each part separately:\n\n- First, we find the homogeneous part. We are given that \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/ed77716162d9ecdeee50cd26172985ed4a5038cad903ca4729da1d9895fc9cc4.svg)\nSince the initial conditions are given at $t = t_0 = 0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}x(0) & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3t} & t{e}^{3t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{3t}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Next, we find the particular solution. Notice that \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/22f92a117def6f3377a72f871d58d23cf339290a55c0f7d297ccb797b5046bf7.svg)\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s) & =[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3(t-s)} & (t-s){e}^{3(t-s)} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{3(t-s)}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3(t-s)} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-3s+3t} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{t}[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-3s+3t} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\text{d}s \\\\  & ={[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{-3s+3t} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{s=0}^{s=t} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{3t}-\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{3t}-\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{3t}-\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3t}-1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14155694/assets/348882682fbf17c25c759980898770a40422158cc3592d1fa51aa73a941f5cb6.svg)",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": null,
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-589680\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"589680\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"21720\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-589680\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Solving an Inhomogeneous System Using a Given Matrix Exponential</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"589680\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margi