xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-74\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.574)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"445\" y=\"-243\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(9409,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-65\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(466,412)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"750\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-74\" x=\"1140\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1501\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-73\" x=\"2280\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"2749\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAINB-67\" x=\"12196\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"12771\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-73\" x=\"13161\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"13630\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"14186\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-73\" x=\"14743\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Therefore, the solution to our IVP is\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"40.908ex\" height=\"10.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -6.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1652.5 17613 4453.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">\n\\mathbf{x}(t) = \\underbrace{e^{A(t-t_0)} \\, \\mathbf{x}(t_0)}_{\\text{homogeneous part}} + \\underbrace{\\int_{t_0}^{t} e^{A(t-s)} \\mathbf{g}(s) \\, \\text{d}s}_{\\text{particular solution}},\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E15-MJMAINB-78\" d=\"M227 0Q212 3 121 3Q40 3 28 0H21V62H117L245 213