"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"859\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2032\" y=\"583\"></use>\n<use x=\"902\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1291\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-74\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1653\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2320\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"3376\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-41\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"4127\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"4734\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"5124\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-74\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"5485\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"6097\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2B\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"7098\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-67\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"7673\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"8063\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-74\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"8424\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"8814\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\nwhere <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 750.5 936.9\" width=\"1.743ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">A</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-41\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-41\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a constant square matrix, and suppose we are given an initial condition <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.843ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -863.1 2201.9 1223.9\" width=\"5.114ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\mathbf{x}(t_0)</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M227 0Q212 3 121 3Q40 3 28 0H21V62H117L245 213L109 382H26V444H34Q49 441 143 441Q247 441 265 444H274V382H246L281 339Q315 297 316 297Q320 297 354 341L389 382H352V444H360Q375 441 466 441Q547 441 559 444H566V382H471L355 246L504 63L545 62H586V0H578Q563 3 469 3Q365 3 347 0H338V62H366Q366 63 326 112T285 163L198 63L217 62H235V0H227Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAINB-78\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-28\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M26 385Q19 392 19 395Q19 399 22 411T27 425Q29 430 36 430T87 431H140L159 511Q162 522 166 540T173 566T179 586T187 603T197 615T211 624T229 626Q247 625 254 615T261 596Q261 589 252 549T232 470L222 433Q222 431 272 431H323Q330 424 330 420Q330 398 317 385H210L174 240Q135 80 135 68Q135 26 162 26Q197 26 230 60T283 144Q285 150 288 151T303 153H307Q322 153 322 145Q322 142 319 133Q314 117 301 95T267 48T216 6T155 -11Q125 -11 98 4T59 56Q57 64 57 83V101L92 241Q127 382 128 383Q128 385 77 385H26Z\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-74\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-29\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAINB-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"607\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-28\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(997,0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-74\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"511\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-30\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"1812\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>.</p>\n<p>Our goal is to derive the formula for the solution <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.843ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -863.1 1748 1223.9\" width=\"4.06ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\mathbf{x}(t)</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M227 0Q212 3 121 3Q40 3 28 0H21V62H117L245 213L109 382H26V444H34Q49 441 143 441Q247 441 265 444H274V382H246L281 339Q315 297 316 297Q320 297 354 341L389 382H352V444H360Q375 441 466 441Q547 441 559 444H566V382H471L355 246L504 63L545 62H586V0H578Q563 3 469 3Q365 3 347 0H338V62H366Q366 63 326 112T285 163L198 63L217 62H235V0H227Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAINB-78\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-28\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M26 385Q19 392 19 395Q19 399 22 411T27 425Q29 430 36 430T87 431H140L159 511Q162 522 166 540T173 566T179 586T187 603T197 615T211 624T229 626Q247 625 254 615T261 596Q261 589 252 549T232 470L222 433Q222 431 272 431H323Q330 424 330 420Q330 398 317 385H210L174 240Q135 80 135 68Q135 26 162 26Q197 26 230 60T283 144Q285 150 288 151T303 153H307Q322 153 322 145Q322 142 319 133Q314 117 301 95T267 48T216 6T155 -11Q125 -11 98 4T59 56Q57 64 57 83V101L92 241Q127 382 128 383Q128 385 77 385H26Z\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-74\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-29\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAINB-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"607\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-28\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"997\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMATHI-74\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1358\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> of the system.</p>\n<p>First, we eliminate the <em>inhomogeneous term</em> by a change of variables. We define\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"3.343ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1078.4 8448.3 1439.2\" width=\"19.622ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.