3397\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-61\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"3897\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-72\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"4643\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-73\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"5038\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-6F\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"5538\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-6C\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"5817\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-75\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"6373\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-74\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"6763\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-69\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"7041\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-6F\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"7542\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<use x=\"17334\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-2C\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\nwhere the first term represents the solution of the corresponding <em>homogeneous system</em>, and the second term gives a particular solution of our <em>inhomogeneous system</em>.</p>\n<p>Let's see some concrete examples.</p>\n</div>"
